    "Cursor is not signed in" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cursor 尚未登录" } } } },
    "Copy the link, sign in with a browser, then return to the app and reconnect." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "复制链接到浏览器完成登录，完成后回到 App 重新连接。" } } } },
    "Copy Link" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "复制链接" } } } },
    "Open in Browser" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "在浏览器打开" } } } },
    "Cursor Login" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cursor 登录" } } } },
    "Claude Login" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Claude 登录" } } } },
    "Codex Login" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Codex 登录" } } } },
    "Gemini Login" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Gemini 登录" } } } },
    "Done signing in, reconnect" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已完成登录，重新连接" } } } },
    "Switch back to KoKo to reconnect automatically." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "完成浏览器操作后切回 KoKo，将自动重新连接。" } } } },
    "Copy the link and sign in in your browser. Switch back to KoKo when done — the session reconnects automatically." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "复制链接到浏览器完成登录，完成后切回 KoKo 即可自动重新连接。" } } } },
    "Open the link in your browser and enter the one-time code there. Switch back to KoKo when done — the session reconnects automatically." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "在浏览器打开链接并输入一次性验证码，完成后切回 KoKo 即可自动重新连接。" } } } },
    "Open the link and sign in. Copy the authorization code, paste it to the server with the button below. If you leave KoKo for the browser, switch back to reconnect automatically, then paste the code." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "打开链接完成登录，复制 authorization code 后点下方按钮粘贴到服务器。若切出 App 去浏览器，切回后会自动重连，再粘贴授权码即可。" } } } },
    "Waiting for login link in terminal…" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "等待终端输出登录链接…" } } } },
    "Open the link in a browser, enter the one-time code, then return here and tap the button below to reconnect." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "在浏览器打开链接并输入一次性验证码，完成后回到 App，点击下方按钮重新连接。" } } } },
    "One-time code" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一次性验证码" } } } },
    "Copy Code" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "复制验证码" } } } },
    "Login link" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "登录链接" } } } },
    "Authorization code" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "授权码" } } } },
    "Send authorization code to terminal" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "发送到服务器终端" } } } },
    "Open the link and sign in. Paste the authorization code into the field below, then tap Send to server terminal." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "打开链接完成登录，将 authorization code 粘贴到下方输入框，再点「发送到服务器终端」。" } } } },
    "Code sent to server terminal" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已发送到服务器终端" } } } },
    "Open the link and sign in. Copy the authorization code from the browser, then paste it into the server terminal with the button below." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "在浏览器打开链接并完成登录，复制 authorization code，再点击下方按钮粘贴到服务器终端。" } } } },
    "Clear All Session History" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "清理全部会话历史" } } } },
    "About" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "关于" } } } },
